{"groups":{"1":{"members":[{"reading":{"answers":[{"num":1,"studentAnswer":"travellers","correct":true,"reference":"travellers"},{"num":2,"studentAnswer":"nature","correct":true,"reference":"nature"},{"num":3,"studentAnswer":"mountains and rivers","correct":true,"reference":"mountains and rivers"},{"num":4,"studentAnswer":"see","correct":true,"reference":"see"},{"num":5,"studentAnswer":"21","correct":true,"reference":"21"},{"num":6,"studentAnswer":"visitted","correct":false,"reference":"visited"},{"num":7,"studentAnswer":"angryly","correct":false,"reference":"angry"},{"num":8,"studentAnswer":"take care of","correct":true,"reference":"take care of"},{"num":9,"studentAnswer":"30","correct":true,"reference":"30"},{"num":10,"studentAnswer":"happy","correct":true,"reference":"happy"}],"comment":"你这次完成得超棒！大部分空都答对了，能看出你对徐霞客相关的知识和单词掌握得很好哦~ 只有2处小失误：第6空你写了visitted，正确拼写应该是visited，注意单词的正确写法；第7空你写了angryly，这里要用到形容词angry，不用副词形式，要多留意词性和单词拼写呀。继续加油，下次肯定会更完美！","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791992365871_5283.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 23:39:28"}},{"reading":{"answers":[{"num":1,"studentAnswer":"travellers","correct":true,"reference":"travellers"},{"num":2,"studentAnswer":"travelling","correct":false,"reference":"nature"},{"num":3,"studentAnswer":"mountains and rivers","correct":true,"reference":"mountains and rivers"},{"num":4,"studentAnswer":"see","correct":true,"reference":"see"},{"num":5,"studentAnswer":"22","correct":false,"reference":"21"},{"num":6,"studentAnswer":"loved","correct":false,"reference":"visited"},{"num":7,"studentAnswer":"sad","correct":false,"reference":"angry"},{"num":8,"studentAnswer":"protect","correct":false,"reference":"take care of"},{"num":9,"studentAnswer":"30","correct":true,"reference":"30"},{"num":10,"studentAnswer":"happy","correct":true,"reference":"happy"}],"comment":"你整体完成得很认真，答对的第1、3、4、9、10空完全正确，值得表扬！答错的我们一起梳理下：第2空写了travelling，正确是nature，注意区分nature（自然）和travelling（旅行）；第5空填22，正确是21，要记准徐霞客出游起始年龄；第6空写loved，正确是visited，这里要表达游历山水的动作而非喜爱；第7空写sad，正确是angry，当时徐霞客看到有人破坏自然是生气的情绪；第8空写protect，正确是take care of，注意短语搭配差异。继续加油，下次肯定能全对！","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791991980754_6938.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 23:33:02"}}]},"2":{"members":[{"opinion":{"content":"I think Xu Xiake is famous.\nI like him because called for people to take of the nature.\nI can learn to write books like him.","comment":"第一句很棒，用词准确！第二句有两处小改进哦：要补充主语「he」，还要把错误表达「take of the nature」改成固定搭配「take care of nature」，修正后句子会更通顺自然。第三句的想法很不错，若改成「travel and write travel notes like him」会更贴合徐霞客的实际事迹。整体完成度很好，继续加油呀！","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791992474608_2573.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 23:41:17"}}]},"3":{"members":[{"reading":{"error":"不是阅读作业","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791991593425_9372.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 23:26:35"}},{"reading":{"answers":[{"num":1,"studentAnswer":"travellers","correct":true,"reference":"travellers"},{"num":2,"studentAnswer":"travelling","correct":false,"reference":"nature"},{"num":3,"studentAnswer":"mountains and rivers","correct":true,"reference":"mountains and rivers"},{"num":4,"studentAnswer":"see","correct":true,"reference":"see"},{"num":5,"studentAnswer":"22","correct":false,"reference":"21"},{"num":6,"studentAnswer":"loved","correct":false,"reference":"visited"},{"num":7,"studentAnswer":"sad","correct":false,"reference":"angry"},{"num":8,"studentAnswer":"protect","correct":false,"reference":"take care of"},{"num":9,"studentAnswer":"30","correct":true,"reference":"30"},{"num":10,"studentAnswer":"happy","correct":true,"reference":"happy"}],"comment":"你这次作业整体表现很棒，答对了6个空，要继续加油哦！帮你梳理下答错的地方：第2空：你写了travelling，正确答案是nature，注意区分nature（自然）和travelling（旅行）的含义；第5空：你填了22，正确是21，要记准徐霞客开始旅行的年龄；第6空：你写了loved，正确是visited，visited更贴合游览的语境；第7空：你填了sad，正确是angry，徐霞客看到有人破坏自然会生气；第8空：你写了protect，正确是take care of，要牢记这个短语用法。其他空都答对啦，多积累知识点，你会越来越出色的！","imag